WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
This surging power...

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.073 --> 00:31.160
Black Jack

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.685 --> 00:59.376
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.376 --> 01:01.369
will be there

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
It makes me glad...

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
yokatta

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
That I found my place here.

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.127 --> 01:13.645
Oh WISDOM

01:13.645 --> 01:15.494
will be there

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
I searched for the reason

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
sagashita

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
as long as we're alive.

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.678 --> 01:34.763
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.847 --> 01:37.031
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.183 --> 01:39.794
His name is Black Jack.

01:55.011 --> 01:55.677
Kocher clamp.

01:55.678 --> 01:57.012
Here you go.

01:59.057 --> 02:00.078
Another one.

02:00.350 --> 02:01.058
OK.

02:13.071 --> 02:14.132
Doc,

02:14.614 --> 02:15.897
what's wrong?

02:16.074 --> 02:17.991
You're not acting normal today.

02:17.992 --> 02:19.483
No, it's nothing.

02:19.911 --> 02:20.577
Give me another one.

02:21.246 --> 02:22.538
And a scalpel.

02:22.539 --> 02:23.303
Here.

02:33.258 --> 02:34.925
Doc...

02:37.498 --> 02:40.558
Originally "Intimidation in the Twentieth Year" by Tezuka Osamu

02:37.498 --> 02:40.558
Intimidation in the Twentieth Year

02:42.062 --> 02:44.273
Come on, Doc!

02:44.481 --> 02:45.689
Wow, Pinoco...
Sit down!

02:46.108 --> 02:47.108
I'm not running a fever!

02:47.109 --> 02:48.025
Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.

02:48.401 --> 02:49.860
Stop fussing!

02:51.491 --> 02:52.668
Sheesh!

02:54.825 --> 02:57.076
Then I'll take your blood pressure.

02:57.661 --> 02:58.911
Stop it, Pinoco.

02:58.912 --> 03:01.205
I'm not running a fever, and my blood
pressure is perfectly normal.

03:01.384 --> 03:05.334
Then why were you spacing out somewhat back there?

03:05.335 --> 03:08.170
I thought you might not be feeling well.

03:09.650 --> 03:10.517
I thought...

03:11.299 --> 03:13.676
I thought my fingers had quit working.

03:13.798 --> 03:16.605
Your fingers quit working?

03:16.763 --> 03:17.346
Yes.

03:17.931 --> 03:19.292
It just felt that way.

03:21.017 --> 03:23.394
Ohmigewdness!

03:23.520 --> 03:27.982
Your fingers quit working?! Why?!

03:27.983 --> 03:28.983
Tell me!

03:30.824 --> 03:31.974
Don't worry about it.

03:32.195 --> 03:36.334
I must be tired from performing
some very intensive operations.

03:37.924 --> 03:39.156
Doc...

03:39.397 --> 03:41.624
Tezuka Clinic

03:43.498 --> 03:45.124
Huh?! Your fingers?!

03:45.461 --> 03:46.734
Yes.

03:47.573 --> 03:51.797
And my fingers froze during the operation today.

03:51.798 --> 03:52.972
That's a big problem.

03:53.341 --> 03:54.616
Did you take any X-rays?

03:58.346 --> 04:01.640
Besides X-rays of my fingers, I
also took an MRI of my brain.

04:02.090 --> 04:04.351
However, I couldn't find any abnormalities.

04:05.103 --> 04:06.478
Then what could it...

04:06.674 --> 04:09.972
The only thing I can think of is...

04:10.734 --> 04:14.153
my fingers were detached once when I was a kid.

04:14.448 --> 04:16.113
Because of that accident?

04:16.698 --> 04:17.531
Yes.

04:19.677 --> 04:20.784
Danger
Undetonated Bombs

04:22.913 --> 04:26.874
After that accident, Dr. Honma performed
reconstruction surgery on me.

04:29.002 --> 04:31.795
That's the only thing I can think of.

04:34.841 --> 04:37.361
But Dr. Honma's operations were always perfect.

04:37.719 --> 04:39.011
He would never make a mistake.

04:39.429 --> 04:42.681
Actually, that just might be the cause.

04:43.697 --> 04:47.430
The operation itself might have been mistake-free,

04:47.646 --> 04:50.611
but your nerves might not have been
able to withstand the stress.

04:50.982 --> 04:54.177
And now that twenty years have
passed, they're getting weak.

04:59.199 --> 05:01.033
My nerves?

05:01.220 --> 05:04.828
Anyway, not being able to move your fingers is a big deal.

05:04.829 --> 05:08.123
For any surgeon, it's a life and...

05:10.335 --> 05:11.297
You're right.

05:11.503 --> 05:15.756
Is this the end of the genius surgeon, Black Jack?

05:15.913 --> 05:18.342
Don't take this lightly!

05:19.094 --> 05:20.010
This is terrible.

05:20.011 --> 05:21.303
We must do something!

05:23.598 --> 05:27.244
We'll find the best surgeon out there
and have him take a look.

05:27.727 --> 05:28.748
Stop it!

05:29.688 --> 05:32.136
There are no surgeons better than Dr. Honma.

05:32.357 --> 05:33.982
Right.

05:34.234 --> 05:37.324
The only one who might be would be yourself.

05:37.696 --> 05:40.454
It's truly a Catch-22.

05:41.574 --> 05:42.438
Yeah.

05:44.244 --> 05:45.167
H-Hey!

05:45.370 --> 05:46.203
Black Jack!

05:47.163 --> 05:50.040
My nerves couldn't withstand the stress, huh?

05:50.667 --> 05:52.459
It's not definite yet...

05:55.255 --> 05:56.422
Hey, wasn't he...

05:57.090 --> 05:58.090
Wait!

06:00.010 --> 06:01.286
I just remembered.

06:01.428 --> 06:03.980
There was a doctor who worked with Dr. Honma.

06:04.306 --> 06:05.306
With Dr. Honma?

06:05.682 --> 06:06.473
Yeah.

06:06.474 --> 06:09.449
Maybe we'll find out something if we
ask him how that operation went.

06:09.728 --> 06:12.404
He's a psychiatrist named Dr. Asakusa.

06:12.731 --> 06:13.772
Why don't you go visit him?

06:13.909 --> 06:15.326
A psychiatrist, huh?

06:15.692 --> 06:17.234
Let's go do that.

06:17.235 --> 06:18.485
I'll go call him!

06:20.572 --> 06:23.379
Maybe he can psychoanalyze me too.

06:23.525 --> 06:24.985
University Hospital

06:29.706 --> 06:31.290
Black Jack.

06:31.291 --> 06:34.752
I even hear about your notorious
practices around psychiatric circles.'

06:35.545 --> 06:38.172
It's finally time for you to give up your profession, huh?

06:38.173 --> 06:39.423
Well, but...

06:39.424 --> 06:42.718
I've been friends with him for a long time, and...

06:42.719 --> 06:44.345
Well, have a seat.

06:44.570 --> 06:47.806
I was surprised when Tezuka told me about you.

06:48.099 --> 06:50.851
So you are the kid from that operation.

06:51.853 --> 06:53.520
Twenty years ago,

06:54.522 --> 06:59.068
when you were brought in, it was very
unlikely that you could be saved,

06:59.069 --> 07:00.903
and everyone lost all hope,

07:01.218 --> 07:03.982
except for Honma, of course,

07:04.449 --> 07:07.285
I remember that very well.

07:08.161 --> 07:10.454
He never gave up.

07:10.455 --> 07:13.082
He performed a splendid operation.

07:13.458 --> 07:18.587
I also remember that I told him a complete
recovery would be impossible.

07:20.507 --> 07:23.634
And that boy is Black Jack, huh?

07:24.094 --> 07:26.941
In any case, you are now my patient-

07:27.198 --> 07:28.782
Tezuka.

07:28.807 --> 07:29.445
Yes?

07:29.672 --> 07:31.558
Would you wait outside?

07:31.559 --> 07:32.746
Yes, doctor.

07:34.145 --> 07:35.757
Do as he says.

07:36.147 --> 07:36.688
Thank you, doctor.

07:39.692 --> 07:42.123
I'm going to hypnotize you.

07:42.404 --> 07:43.112
All right?

07:45.240 --> 07:46.559
You're going to hypnotize me?

07:46.866 --> 07:49.952
I only came here to ask you about
the operation twenty years ago.

07:50.495 --> 07:52.621
There have been cases where physical impairments,

07:52.622 --> 07:55.822
for which the cause was unknown, ultimately were
found to be caused by psychological reasons.

07:56.042 --> 07:58.794
I'm going to explore that possibility using hypnosis.

07:59.087 --> 08:03.298
Now, close your eyes slowly while looking at this.

08:05.051 --> 08:06.023
What's the matter?

08:06.302 --> 08:08.762
Can't you trust me?

08:09.222 --> 08:09.937
I can.

08:10.473 --> 08:12.516
You may be a highly skilled surgeon,

08:12.517 --> 08:16.854
but right now, you are my patient,
and I'm the doctor treating you.

08:17.109 --> 08:20.889
Don't you want your hands to get better?

08:21.276 --> 08:22.184
All right.

08:28.283 --> 08:31.451
You feel very relaxed and are getting sleepy.

08:31.452 --> 08:34.491
You will fall into a deep sleep at the count of three.

08:34.873 --> 08:37.092
One. Two.

08:37.333 --> 08:38.917
Three.

08:42.755 --> 08:44.868
You are traveling back in time.

08:45.049 --> 08:47.208
Back to twenty years ago.

08:58.146 --> 09:00.765
What do you see?

09:01.399 --> 09:02.783
Dr. Honma...

09:04.819 --> 09:07.031
Is he saying anything?

09:08.656 --> 09:09.491
It's all right.

09:09.824 --> 09:12.963
You will recover.

09:13.620 --> 09:18.685
Dr. Honma is cheering me up with a smile.

09:19.959 --> 09:20.917
And then?

09:22.086 --> 09:25.860
Dr. Honma is talking with someone in the hallway.

09:26.090 --> 09:28.841
With whom and what is he talking about?

09:29.052 --> 09:30.072
I don't know.

09:30.595 --> 09:32.327
It is fading away.

09:33.014 --> 09:34.626
Fading away?

09:34.849 --> 09:35.863
What's going on?

09:36.184 --> 09:40.949
Oh, Dr. Honma is rushing back into the room.

09:41.523 --> 09:42.648
Now what?!

09:42.649 --> 09:43.649
What happened?!

09:43.650 --> 09:44.775
I don't know.

09:44.776 --> 09:47.055
His condition suddenly got worse.

09:49.614 --> 09:51.532
Doctor, his brain waves are...

09:51.533 --> 09:52.407
What?!

09:53.743 --> 09:56.105
My brain waves suddenly get weaker,

09:56.538 --> 09:59.957
and Dr. Honma and the others
are frantically working on me.

10:00.708 --> 10:03.919
Why did your brain waves suddenly get weaker?

10:07.715 --> 10:10.342
You were doing so well!

10:10.760 --> 10:12.844
Please don't disappoint me!

10:13.513 --> 10:16.223
Doctor, his brain waves are getting even weaker.

10:16.357 --> 10:17.077
Hey!

10:17.392 --> 10:18.538
Hang in there!

10:20.186 --> 10:24.755
Now remember the time right before Honma came back.

10:26.317 --> 10:27.697
Hey! Black Jack!

10:30.321 --> 10:31.554
I can't.

10:31.864 --> 10:33.323
This is the important part!

10:33.324 --> 10:34.132
Remember!

10:34.284 --> 10:35.784
What happened then?!

10:37.328 --> 10:39.288
I don't remember.

10:39.747 --> 10:40.998
Very well.

10:40.999 --> 10:44.960
Wake up at the count of three.

10:44.961 --> 10:48.755
One. Two. Three.

10:52.078 --> 10:53.676
Doctor, what happened to me?

10:53.845 --> 10:56.471
I couldn't figure out the most critical point.

10:56.472 --> 10:57.307
The most critical-point?

10:57.682 --> 10:58.515
Right.

10:58.516 --> 11:01.476
You were recovering well.

11:01.686 --> 11:07.024
But at one point, your brain waves started getting
weaker and then fell into a critical condition.

11:07.397 --> 11:12.716
But it seems the specific memory that should
reveal the cause is blocked for some reason.

11:12.947 --> 11:18.493
The reason why your fingers quit
working may be hidden within it.

11:24.917 --> 11:26.816
All done!

11:27.462 --> 11:34.426
Here is the dinner I made especially
for Doc so he'll feel better!

11:38.032 --> 11:38.574
No!

11:39.724 --> 11:41.308
Oh! He's back!

11:41.587 --> 11:44.436
Welcome home, Doc!

11:44.437 --> 11:47.022
We have a special dinner tonight.

11:47.023 --> 11:47.606
Right?

11:47.607 --> 11:48.649
I have work to do

11:48.650 --> 11:49.232
Please don't bother me.

12:14.384 --> 12:15.550
Why?!

12:15.885 --> 12:16.635
Why?!

12:17.178 --> 12:18.667
Why?!

12:18.888 --> 12:19.808
Doc!

12:21.140 --> 12:22.599
Are you OK?

12:22.600 --> 12:25.199
Please leave me alone.

12:26.104 --> 12:26.987
Please.

12:30.692 --> 12:31.653
Why?

12:32.568 --> 12:34.528
Why won't they move like they should?

12:34.904 --> 12:35.862
Move!

12:35.988 --> 12:36.947
Move!

12:37.600 --> 12:40.200
What's going to happen to my career?

12:41.119 --> 12:42.619
This is hard.

12:42.620 --> 12:43.815
This is harder than dying.

12:45.164 --> 12:50.476
<i>The reason why your fingers quit
working may be hidden within it.</i>

12:51.546 --> 12:54.548
What happened back then?

12:56.050 --> 12:57.543
What is the reason?

12:58.761 --> 13:00.053
Somebody tell me!

13:24.328 --> 13:25.495
Shut up!

13:26.664 --> 13:29.000
Hey, is this really the right place?

13:29.167 --> 13:29.875
Yeah.

13:30.460 --> 13:32.773
Hey, is anyone here?

13:33.296 --> 13:35.297
Who are you guys?

13:35.298 --> 13:36.548
We have a patient in critical condition.

13:36.549 --> 13:37.924
He needs to see the doctor right now.

13:38.342 --> 13:40.135
Hurry up!

13:40.136 --> 13:40.653
Yes, sir.

13:41.069 --> 13:42.095
We're coming in,

13:42.346 --> 13:43.764
No!

13:43.890 --> 13:46.349
Doc's busy right now!

13:46.440 --> 13:47.726
You can't come in!

13:47.846 --> 13:49.060
Don't give me that crap!

13:49.061 --> 13:51.354
Who do you think this is?!

13:51.355 --> 13:52.939
Go get the doctor right now!

13:52.940 --> 13:54.024
No!

13:54.221 --> 13:55.442
What's going on here?

13:57.278 --> 13:58.612
Doc!

14:01.991 --> 14:03.283
Take the patient to the examination room.

14:03.284 --> 14:05.003
Doc?!

14:06.037 --> 14:08.038
How is he?

14:08.039 --> 14:09.539
Do something!

14:12.502 --> 14:14.628
It's a case of acute cardiac infarction.

14:14.629 --> 14:15.629
We don't have-much time.

14:15.630 --> 14:17.756
Then work on him right now!

14:17.757 --> 14:22.588
If anything goes wrong, we'll make it so you
can never pick up your scalpel again!

14:23.763 --> 14:26.431
I'd have helped him even without your threats.

14:26.432 --> 14:27.446
However,

14:28.100 --> 14:30.143
this operation will cost you ¥100,000,000.

14:31.145 --> 14:33.041
¥100,000,000?!

14:33.525 --> 14:35.132
Are you crazy?

14:36.150 --> 14:37.150
I'll pay!

14:37.151 --> 14:39.861
I'll pay anything, so please!

14:41.197 --> 14:42.697
Pinoco, prepare for an emergency operation.

14:42.698 --> 14:43.031
Hurry!

14:48.454 --> 14:49.204
Come in.

14:50.091 --> 14:51.706
Excuse me.

14:53.084 --> 14:54.281
Dr. Asakusa!

14:55.002 --> 14:57.045
This room is still full of these.

14:57.488 --> 14:59.256
What brings you here?

15:05.137 --> 15:08.056
Are you OK, Doc?

15:08.641 --> 15:10.877
I'll get this done for the sake of my pride.

15:11.566 --> 15:14.229
If I need to, I'll even tie the scalpel to my hand.

15:14.230 --> 15:14.985
But,

15:15.731 --> 15:18.391
your hands are shaking.

15:18.609 --> 15:19.693
Don't push yourself too much.

15:20.903 --> 15:21.753
Pinoco,

15:22.029 --> 15:25.282
cutting means everything to me.

15:26.284 --> 15:28.828
What would be left if it was taken from me?

15:30.246 --> 15:31.019
You see?

15:35.209 --> 15:36.068
Let's get started.

15:36.502 --> 15:37.155
Scalpel.

15:37.740 --> 15:38.920
Aye-aye.

15:49.015 --> 15:51.606
Doc, please stop this!

15:55.855 --> 15:56.730
Damn!

15:57.440 --> 15:58.947
It's impossible!

15:59.136 --> 16:01.443
I hate doctors!

16:01.444 --> 16:02.374
Shut up!

16:05.531 --> 16:06.364
Doc!

16:06.949 --> 16:08.408
Be quiet, Pinoco.

16:18.753 --> 16:19.669
Why?!

16:19.962 --> 16:20.698
Why?!

16:25.092 --> 16:26.275
Doc?

16:26.677 --> 16:29.683
Pinoco, I...

16:31.425 --> 16:33.516
Please stop, Doc!

16:33.517 --> 16:35.060
It's impossible!

16:35.061 --> 16:37.228
You can't do this!

16:37.688 --> 16:39.053
Quit saying the word "impossible” so many times!

16:39.523 --> 16:41.441
It's intimidating me to the point where
I'm starting to think it is!

16:41.875 --> 16:43.151
<i>Intimidating me?!</i>

16:46.884 --> 16:50.367
In only twenty years, your work will...

16:55.207 --> 16:58.564
Your visit surprised me.

16:59.835 --> 17:02.212
I was concerned about Black Jack.

17:02.639 --> 17:04.682
Isn't there any cure for him?

17:05.299 --> 17:10.428
I think the reason is hidden in the partial
memory loss he's experiencing.

17:10.429 --> 17:11.554
How?

17:11.847 --> 17:13.098
I don't know.

17:13.808 --> 17:16.726
He's the only one who would know.

17:20.032 --> 17:20.585
Yes.

17:21.199 --> 17:21.792
Hmm.

17:21.816 --> 17:23.805
Black Jack?!

17:24.359 --> 17:25.563
What's the rush?

17:25.845 --> 17:26.653
What?!

17:26.654 --> 17:28.071
You're in the middle of an operation?!

17:28.656 --> 17:32.117
He said he learned you were visiting
me when he called the hospital.

17:32.493 --> 17:35.453
He asked you to come to his place right away.

17:35.454 --> 17:38.256
What happened?

17:44.630 --> 17:45.911
Who are you?

17:46.132 --> 17:48.671
We're busy here.

17:48.713 --> 17:49.759
Come again later.

17:49.760 --> 17:51.560
This will affect the patient's life!

17:51.887 --> 17:52.637
Let us through!

17:52.725 --> 17:53.972
Shut up!

17:53.973 --> 17:55.306
Get lost now.

17:56.020 --> 17:57.121
What?!

17:57.493 --> 17:59.310
Let me handle this.

17:59.854 --> 18:00.918
What the hell?

18:01.188 --> 18:02.564
Want a piece of this?

18:02.898 --> 18:04.607
Sleep!

18:09.644 --> 18:10.830
Let's go.

18:15.119 --> 18:15.910
Dr. Asakusa.

18:16.230 --> 18:18.621
Black Jack, what are you...

18:18.622 --> 18:22.417
Doctor, there's something I want you to remember.

18:22.418 --> 18:23.334
Me?

18:23.625 --> 18:26.755
I believe you discussed something with Dr. Honma...

18:26.756 --> 18:29.132
after the surgery on me was complete,
in front of the operating room.

18:29.504 --> 18:31.339
Remember what you said then.

18:32.261 --> 18:34.095
I discussed something with Dr. Honma?

18:34.548 --> 18:35.175
Right.

18:35.434 --> 18:38.764
Something about what would happen
to his operation in twenty years...

18:38.980 --> 18:40.438
Twenty years?

18:40.439 --> 18:43.567
Damn! I can't remember anything else!

18:44.026 --> 18:48.238
There must be some hint to why it's blocked
in the words that followed after that.

18:48.239 --> 18:49.531
Please remember!

18:49.656 --> 18:51.227
My words?

18:51.637 --> 18:53.235
Wait a minute.

18:53.578 --> 18:55.120
With Honma-kun...

18:56.038 --> 18:56.997
Could it be?!

18:57.582 --> 19:01.215
When I ran into Honma-kun in the hallway...

19:01.460 --> 19:02.961
Hey, Dr. Asakusa.

19:03.209 --> 19:06.173
How's the boy doing, Dr. Honma?

19:06.382 --> 19:07.924
Take a look.

19:08.467 --> 19:13.722
You were opposed to the operation,
but he's recovering well.

19:13.968 --> 19:19.597
To be honest, at that moment I became jealous
of Honma's splendid talent and skills.

19:19.896 --> 19:20.687
And...

19:21.185 --> 19:22.564
No...

19:23.649 --> 19:25.650
Your operation was a failure!

19:25.833 --> 19:27.360
Wh-Why?

19:27.695 --> 19:30.322
Different parts of his body,

19:30.573 --> 19:35.035
like his hands or his fingers, will probably
stop working in twenty years.

19:39.081 --> 19:40.957
Yes, that's it!

19:41.667 --> 19:44.761
And I became despondent after hearing that.

19:45.215 --> 19:51.051
So the reason your brain waves
weakened was because of that too.

19:51.802 --> 19:54.530
And because of the enormous fear I felt,

19:54.931 --> 19:57.307
I blocked both those words and
my memory of that moment.

19:57.767 --> 19:58.870
That's it!

19:59.101 --> 20:03.208
You must have gotten back on the road
to recovery after you blocked it.

20:03.439 --> 20:08.628
But those words are still intimidating me now,
preventing my fingers from working properly.

20:09.998 --> 20:13.629
You were intimidated by my words.

20:13.783 --> 20:15.951
So now that we know...

20:16.452 --> 20:17.474
Black Jack!

20:20.373 --> 20:21.706
The feeling in my hands...

20:22.375 --> 20:23.333
is back!

20:24.081 --> 20:25.081
Doc!

20:37.640 --> 20:39.057
Time to resume the operation.

20:40.434 --> 20:41.518
Pinoco, scalpel.

20:43.854 --> 20:45.522
Aye-aye!

21:07.420 --> 21:11.734
Your fingers really stopped working after twenty years...

21:13.009 --> 21:17.721
The human psyche and well-being
are very closely intertwined.

21:18.723 --> 21:25.167
I fell into the trap because, somewhere in my mind,
I had some doubt about Dr. Honma's abilities.

21:25.479 --> 21:27.689
I'm terribly sorry, Doctor.

21:28.399 --> 21:30.608
No, it's all my fault.

21:30.860 --> 21:36.573
I almost ruined Dr. Honma's masterpiece
with my careless words.

21:36.574 --> 21:37.720
I'm sorry.

21:38.034 --> 21:38.949
It's OK.

21:39.285 --> 21:47.250
It's a good reminder that we can't
cure people with skill alone.

21:52.506 --> 21:55.675
We can't cure people with skill alone...

21:57.261 --> 21:58.387
Dr. Honma...

22:10.552 --> 22:17.558
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.552 --> 22:17.558
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.559 --> 22:24.731
Only look straight at me.

22:17.559 --> 22:24.731
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.776 --> 22:32.033
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.776 --> 22:32.033
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.034 --> 22:42.543
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.034 --> 22:42.543
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.544 --> 22:47.924
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.544 --> 22:47.924
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.925 --> 22:57.308
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.925 --> 22:53.130
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.585 --> 22:57.309
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.309 --> 23:08.069
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.309 --> 23:08.069
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.070 --> 23:13.157
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.070 --> 23:13.157
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.158 --> 23:26.128
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.158 --> 23:26.128
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.129 --> 23:33.052
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.129 --> 23:33.052
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.053 --> 23:43.938
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.053 --> 23:36.986
sora no hate tooku

23:37.079 --> 23:43.879
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.134 --> 24:15.090
The Terror of the Azure Sea

23:47.548 --> 23:48.188
Is it...

23:48.301 --> 23:49.421
Want to fight?

23:49.454 --> 23:51.001
He's underestimating the terror of the sea.

23:51.088 --> 23:52.781
He may die in it.

23:52.901 --> 23:56.354
Are all fishermen chickens like you?

23:56.594 --> 23:58.521
Don't make fun of fishermen!

23:58.814 --> 23:59.509
We need an operation.

23:59.662 --> 24:02.347
But I've never performed an operation
like the before.

24:02.827 --> 24:04.427
I haven't given up yet.

24:07.207 --> 24:08.938
The sea is the same as always, but...

24:08.971 --> 24:09.764
Am I done for?

24:10.597 --> 24:11.597
Don't die!

24:11.798 --> 24:14.318
Next Karte - The Terror of the Azure Sea.

24:16.134 --> 24:17.885
Karte NG...

24:18.637 --> 24:19.406
Shut up!

24:20.013 --> 24:20.533
Damn!

24:21.306 --> 24:22.395
Oh? Huh?
